    {
      "speakerId": "501465606365443254883",
      "topic": "Discussion",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "start": 11100,
          "end": 13100,
          "text": "Yeah, sorry for the delay."
        },
        {
          "start": 13250,
          "end": 16850,
          "text": "Things got a little more complicated on our end."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speakerId": "342675763540280906633",
      "topic": "Discussion",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "start": 17400,
          "end": 19400,
          "text": "No worries, what's going on?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speakerId": "501465606365443254883",
      "topic": "Discussion",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "start": 19950,
          "end": 23950,
          "text": "So, we actually got some pushback internally on the price."
        },
        {
          "start": 24100,
          "end": 31700,
          "text": "Finance came back and said the number was higher than they'd modeled for this category of tool this year."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speakerId": "342675763540280906633",
      "topic": "Discussion",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "start": 32250,
          "end": 32650,
          "text": "Understood."
        },
        {
          "start": 32800,
          "end": 39200,
          "text": "Is there flexibility on scope that might help, or is it strictly a budget ceiling issue?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speakerId": "501465606365443254883",
      "topic": "Discussion",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "start": 39750,
          "end": 41350,
          "text": "Bit of both, honestly."
        },
        {
          "start": 41500,
          "end": 47100,
          "text": "And I'll be straight with you, we're also taking a look at Meadowlight."
        },
        {
          "start": 47250,
          "end": 54850,
          "text": "Their number came in lower, and a couple of the directors want a bake-off before we commit to anything."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speakerId": "342675763540280906633",
      "topic": "Discussion",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "start": 55400,
          "end": 57400,
          "text": "Appreciate you telling me directly."
        },
        {
          "start": 57550,
          "end": 61950,
          "text": "What matters most to you and your team in that comparison?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speakerId": "501465606365443254883",
      "topic": "Discussion",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "start": 62500,
          "end": 69300,
          "text": "For us it's really the reporting depth and how well it plugs into our existing HR systems."
        },
        {
          "start": 69450,
          "end": 77450,
          "text": "Meadowlight's cheaper but from what I've seen their performance review depth is pretty shallow compared to their survey side."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speakerId": "342675763540280906633",
      "topic": "Discussion",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "start": 78000,
          "end": 79600,
          "text": "That's helpful to know."
        },
        {
          "start": 79750,
          "end": 85750,
          "text": "Would it be useful if I put together a side-by-side on the reporting piece specifically?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speakerId": "501465606365443254883",
      "topic": "Discussion",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "start": 86300,
          "end": 88300,
          "text": "Yeah, that would help internally."
        },
        {
          "start": 88450,
          "end": 95250,
          "text": "I think the team leans our direction but the price gap is a real conversation right now."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
